  "title": "STM32F722RET6 Country of Origin Issues",
  "content": "<p>Hello Sir,<br />We are currently facing a <strong>Country of Origin (COO)</strong> issue regarding the <strong>STM32F722RET6</strong> MCU and would appreciate your assistance in clarifying the following questions.</p><ol><li>Could you please confirm whether the <strong>Country of Origin (COO)</strong> of the <strong>STM32F722RET6</strong> is <strong>France</strong>, as indicated on the STMicroelectronics official website?</li>\t<li>Could you please provide the manufacturing locations for the <strong>STM32F722RET6</strong>, including:\t<ul><li><strong>Wafer Fabrication (Wafer Fab) location</strong></li>\t\t<li><strong>Assembly location</strong></li>\t\t<li><strong>Testing location</strong></li>\t</ul></li></ol><p>Your prompt assistance would be greatly appreciated.</p>",
